WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.908
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.178 --> 00:02.546
(This drama merged facts with fiction and plots may differ from records.)

3
00:02.612 --> 00:03.947
(Children and animals were filmed with the aid of guardians and experts.)

4
00:04.014 --> 00:05.015
(Some scenes were made using generative AI.)

5
00:06.216 --> 00:08.819
(Daeyaseong, Silla, modern-day Hapcheon)

6
00:34.811 --> 00:37.247
Juk Juk, what are you staring at?

7
00:38.348 --> 00:41.117
- It is nothing, sir. - It is all right, so speak your mind.

8
00:41.852 --> 00:43.220
(Juk Juk, Silla's official)

9
00:43.286 --> 00:45.088
Seeing you today, General,

10
00:45.155 --> 00:48.225
reminds me of how you led us at Okmungok Valley four years ago.

11
00:48.859 --> 00:51.394
(Kim Pum Seok, lord of Daeyaseong, Kim Chun Chu's son-in-law)

12
00:53.063 --> 00:54.898
You must stay alert as well.

13
00:55.499 --> 00:57.934
From now on, we will begin rigorous training.

14
01:01.671 --> 01:04.474
We will protect this fortress no matter what.

15
01:04.975 --> 01:05.976
Yes, General.

16
01:14.451 --> 01:18.388
Looking at that river, I wonder if this is truly a battlefield.

17
01:24.094 --> 01:25.862
Is life here difficult for you?

18
01:26.763 --> 01:29.332
(Kim Go Ta So, Kim Pum Seok's wife, Kim Chun Chu's daughter)

19
01:29.399 --> 01:31.635
It cannot be as hard as it is for our father,

20
01:31.968 --> 01:33.537
who is traveling everywhere for our nation.

21
01:37.707 --> 01:38.742
I am sorry...

22
01:38.808 --> 01:40.043
(Kim Beop Min, Kim Chun Chu's eldest son)

23
01:40.343 --> 01:42.078
that you got married in my stead.

24
01:46.716 --> 01:49.085
Are you crying again, Brother?

25
01:54.524 --> 01:58.461
I have been blessed with lovely children under such a clear sky.

26
02:00.463 --> 02:02.699
I am happy, Brother.

27
02:07.037 --> 02:10.874
Are you still wandering, Brother?

28
02:14.978 --> 02:16.980
Do I look pathetic to you as well?

29
02:19.316 --> 02:23.019
You resemble our father very much.

30
02:24.487 --> 02:25.922
I take after Father?

31
02:27.157 --> 02:31.161
You hide your true feelings and agonize over things.

32
02:31.227 --> 02:34.564
You may look cold, but I know you are more passionate than anyone.

33
02:35.599 --> 02:36.866
I know that one day,

34
02:37.867 --> 02:41.605
you will make up your mind.

35
02:43.173 --> 02:46.610
So for now, just follow your heart.

36
03:03.426 --> 03:05.428
What is this?

37
03:06.563 --> 03:08.431
Did I not tell you recently?

38
03:09.065 --> 03:11.334
I brought it because I thought it would suit you well.

39
03:26.282 --> 03:27.484
How do I look?

40
03:28.585 --> 03:29.586
Is it pretty?

41
03:29.986 --> 03:30.987
It is beautiful.

42
03:32.889 --> 03:33.923
You look lovely.

43
03:39.062 --> 03:41.464
What are you two talking about so happily?

44
03:42.832 --> 03:45.835
About how my brother is becoming just like you, Father.

45
03:46.369 --> 03:48.371
(Kim Chun Chu, Silla's Minister of Military Affairs)

46
03:49.339 --> 03:52.575
Once the army arrives here from Seorabeol,

47
03:53.543 --> 03:57.247
you will be able to return to Seorabeol.

48
03:58.782 --> 04:02.652
When you return, we shall all go see the flowers as a family.

49
04:03.353 --> 04:06.489
Soon, the flowers on Mount Namsan behind Wolseong will be in full bloom.

50
04:07.424 --> 04:08.558
Is that for sure?

51
04:10.694 --> 04:13.463
And after speaking with General Kim Pum Seok,

52
04:14.297 --> 04:17.233
it seems there will be no issues defending this fortress for now.

53
04:19.135 --> 04:22.405
Do you really think so, Father?

54
04:23.206 --> 04:24.908
Actually, I felt it too.

55
04:25.508 --> 04:28.078
The General has changed somehow.

56
04:29.713 --> 04:31.214
Grandpa is right.

57
04:33.349 --> 04:35.618
Yes, you are right.

58
04:36.086 --> 04:41.224
My, this little one is starting to look just like him.

59
04:43.626 --> 04:46.396
I have never seen you smile so brightly.

60
04:46.463 --> 04:48.098
Shall we catch butterflies?

61
04:48.164 --> 04:49.199
Shall we?

62
05:00.110 --> 05:02.645
(Sabiseong, Baekje, modern-day Buyeo)

63
05:07.617 --> 05:10.186
(To King Uija)

64
05:12.155 --> 05:14.724
(King Uija, 31st ruler of Baekje)

65
05:22.565 --> 05:23.566
(Goguryeo)

66
05:23.633 --> 05:26.169
I heard the ruler of Goguryeo has changed.

67
05:26.236 --> 05:30.039
Yeon Gae So Mun staged a coup and took control of Goguryeo.

68
05:30.140 --> 05:32.542
It was sent by Minister Seong Chung.

69
05:32.609 --> 05:34.544
Ko Geon Mu is dead.

70
05:37.580 --> 05:41.518
The heavens have finally given me...

71
05:42.452 --> 05:45.555
a chance to destroy Silla.

72
05:46.089 --> 05:47.590
Yeon Gae So Mun is ambitious,

73
05:47.657 --> 05:51.561
unlike Ko Geon Mu, who repeatedly delayed Your Majesty's peace proposals.

74
05:51.628 --> 05:52.629
I am certain...

75
05:54.197 --> 05:58.168
that he will be inclined to destroy the weak Silla first.

76
05:59.602 --> 06:00.603
(Sang Yeong, Baekje's general)

77
06:00.670 --> 06:02.305
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

78
06:02.372 --> 06:05.742
This is finally our chance to annihilate Silla.

79
06:06.209 --> 06:10.079
You can conquer Daeyaseong and enter Seorabeol in a single stroke.

80
06:25.395 --> 06:26.763
(Dangseong Fortress)

81
06:27.564 --> 06:28.565
Dangseong...

82
06:28.631 --> 06:29.632
(Dangseong, modern-day Hwaseong)

83
06:29.699 --> 06:30.700
Dangseong!

84
06:32.235 --> 06:34.270
It is an unexpected strategic point, Your Majesty!

85
06:35.405 --> 06:39.542
Daeyaseong is a natural fortress, making cooperation with Goguryeo hard,

86
06:39.609 --> 06:43.313
but a pincer attack is possible at Dangseong Fortress, is it not?

87
06:43.913 --> 06:45.148
If Dangseong is cut off,

88
06:45.215 --> 06:47.483
Silla cannot send envoys to the Tang Dynasty,

89
06:48.017 --> 06:49.485
nor will they be able to trade.

90
06:51.688 --> 06:55.892
They will be completely trapped like rats in a jar!

91
07:02.232 --> 07:06.603
The time has come to utilize the power of Goguryeo.

92
07:07.470 --> 07:09.572
I will order our minister in Pyongyangseong...

93
07:09.639 --> 07:12.141
to ensure that the pincer attack is successful.

94
07:13.576 --> 07:18.715
We will seize Dangseong with Goguryeo, cutting Silla's path to the West Sea,

95
07:20.083 --> 07:22.719
and carve out its heart...

96
07:24.254 --> 07:27.957
so that it can never rise again.

97
07:28.024 --> 07:29.993
Silla will be destroyed,

98
07:30.059 --> 07:32.161
and your era is not far off.

99
07:32.228 --> 07:34.097
- That is correct, Your Majesty! - Yes, Your Majesty!

100
07:38.401 --> 07:41.938
(Episode 3: The Die is Cast)

101
08:01.224 --> 08:04.494
You are asking me to attack Silla with you.

102
08:05.295 --> 08:06.429
Indeed.

103
08:07.130 --> 08:09.332
If Goguryeo and Baekje work together,

104
08:09.399 --> 08:11.935
Silla will lose Dangseong Fortress in an instant.

105
08:19.108 --> 08:20.143
Circumstances...

106
08:20.209 --> 08:21.377
(Yeon Gae So Mun, Goguryeo's Grand Chancellor)

107
08:21.444 --> 08:24.781
are always subject to change, Lord Seong Chung.

108
08:25.448 --> 08:28.017
(Seong Chung, envoy from Baekje)

109
08:28.651 --> 08:34.090
Do you know the current situation of Goguryeo?

110
08:35.124 --> 08:39.262
Are you not currently rectifying the chaos in Goguryeo, Supreme Commander?

111
08:41.464 --> 08:43.566
I meant the Goguryeo that was in chaos.

112
08:46.002 --> 08:48.104
The chaos in Goguryeo...

113
08:58.614 --> 09:00.550
Despite knowing the situation,

114
09:00.683 --> 09:06.055
you seem more interested in my troops than in worrying about Goguryeo.

115
09:06.155 --> 09:10.593
The mere deployment of Goguryeo's army will cause great chaos in Silla.

116
09:10.660 --> 09:14.764
If Silla is destroyed, it will be of great benefit to you.

117
09:21.270 --> 09:25.508
What is it that you want, Supreme Commander?

118
09:25.575 --> 09:27.343
If you would only provide the troops...

119
09:29.946 --> 09:32.648
If the Goguryeo army sets out,

120
09:34.517 --> 09:37.020
what will you give me in return?

121
09:38.521 --> 09:41.858
- All hail, the Baekje army! - All hail, the Baekje army!

122
09:41.924 --> 09:43.459
(Land of Baekje, south of Dangseong, Silla)

123
09:45.194 --> 09:49.065
- All hail, the Baekje army! - All hail, the Baekje army!

124
09:49.132 --> 09:51.267
They are aiming for Dangseong.

125
09:51.334 --> 09:52.969
We must inform the beacon tower quickly.

126
09:53.036 --> 09:54.404
- Let us do so. - Yes, sir.

127
10:07.784 --> 10:09.819
Goodness, I am so sick of this.

128
10:09.886 --> 10:12.855
Why do those beacons go up at all hours of the day?

129
10:12.922 --> 10:14.390
Darn it!

130
10:15.858 --> 10:17.894
Make way! I am a messenger!

131
10:25.068 --> 10:26.903
They say the beacon started from Dangseong.

132
10:26.969 --> 10:27.970
Dangseong Fortress?

133
10:28.805 --> 10:29.972
But how could...

134
10:33.242 --> 10:35.278
A large Baekje army is heading toward Dangseong,

135
10:35.344 --> 10:36.913
and troops have also emerged from Pyongyangseong.

136
10:36.979 --> 10:37.980
What?

137
10:38.214 --> 10:41.350
- Did Goguryeo deploy its troops? - No, how could Ko Geon Mu...

138
10:41.417 --> 10:44.387
I heard Yeon Gae So Mun killed the King and took over the throne.

139
10:49.459 --> 10:50.526
We cannot delay any longer.

140
10:51.727 --> 10:53.296
I must return to Seorabeol at once.

141
10:53.362 --> 10:54.363
Get ready.

142
10:57.967 --> 10:59.435
What are you doing?

143
10:59.502 --> 11:01.904
I told you to get ready to return to Seorabeol immediately!

144
11:08.377 --> 11:10.079
Take good care of your father.

145
11:10.146 --> 11:13.049
I swear to protect this fortress at all costs.

146
11:13.950 --> 11:15.051
Do not worry.

147
11:18.988 --> 11:20.056
Grandpa.

148
12:02.798 --> 12:06.669
I will defend this place until the end, so do not worry and go save Silla.

149
12:09.472 --> 12:12.208
All right, I will see you soon.

150
12:56.986 --> 12:58.654
(Kim Jin Ju, Silla's general, a Jingol)

151
13:01.023 --> 13:02.692
Have all 2,000 troops assembled?

152
13:02.758 --> 13:03.893
Yes, General!

153
13:05.828 --> 13:07.530
I have seen my future.

154
13:08.197 --> 13:11.968
I will surely protect this nation!

155
13:12.868 --> 13:14.270
I will not die.

156
13:16.572 --> 13:17.673
And you will not die either.

157
13:19.141 --> 13:21.177
(Kim Jin Heum, Silla's commander, Kim Jin Ju's younger brother)

158
13:23.479 --> 13:26.015
Long live, General Kim Jin Ju!

159
13:26.115 --> 13:27.850
- Long live the general! - Long live the general!

160
13:29.185 --> 13:30.186
Let us go!

161
13:30.253 --> 13:31.420
- Yes, General! - Yes, General!

162
13:38.527 --> 13:40.696
What on earth are you doing?

163
13:42.398 --> 13:45.601
Do you ask because you do not know? I am on my way to protect our nation.

164
13:46.969 --> 13:50.573
My friend Jin Ju, this nation will not fall that easily.

165
13:55.511 --> 13:58.214
The Queen's time is just coming to an end.

166
14:01.684 --> 14:03.686
Are you truly planning to oppose me?

167
14:07.890 --> 14:11.794
I love Silla, but I do not want to lose you.

168
14:15.498 --> 14:19.035
- Stand by for now. - Stand by!

169
14:19.502 --> 14:20.503
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

170
14:36.485 --> 14:37.520
(Queen Seondeok, 27th ruler of Silla)

171
14:37.620 --> 14:41.123
- Who is protecting Dangseong... - Beacons rise from the Baekje border.

172
14:41.791 --> 14:43.259
And we were in the dark...

173
14:43.326 --> 14:47.029
until refugees from Goguryeo brought news of Yeon Gae So Mun's deployment.

174
14:47.863 --> 14:50.132
The absurd decisions made by the Minister of Military Affairs...

175
14:50.199 --> 14:54.437
and his act of abandoning Seorabeol is unforgivable!

176
14:54.737 --> 14:55.771
That is correct.

177
14:55.838 --> 15:00.843
- He is correct. - Punish him.

178
15:00.910 --> 15:04.313
Dangseong is the lifeline of Silla.

179
15:05.514 --> 15:06.749
If we lose Dangseong,

180
15:07.583 --> 15:10.820
all communication with Tang will be cut off, and we will be isolated.

181
15:11.287 --> 15:13.656
We will be left with nothing but to wait for death.

182
15:14.123 --> 15:16.325
We must protect Dangseong.

183
15:16.392 --> 15:19.161
Your Majesty, your words are absolutely correct,

184
15:19.995 --> 15:24.734
but our swords are far too small to stop the massive armies of the two nations.

185
15:25.735 --> 15:30.573
Baekje has 20,000, and Goguryeo has at least 50,000 troops.

186
15:31.907 --> 15:35.077
- This is bad news. - What should we do?

187
15:35.745 --> 15:39.181
But we cannot just sit back and do nothing, can we?

188
15:39.248 --> 15:41.150
We must do whatever we can.

189
15:42.351 --> 15:45.154
Who will go and stop them?

190
15:56.799 --> 15:58.234
General Su Se.

191
15:58.300 --> 16:01.637
Your Majesty, my troops are but old soldiers.

192
16:02.104 --> 16:04.673
They cannot possibly face the Goguryeo cavalry.

193
16:07.576 --> 16:09.445
I do not see General Jin Bok.

194
16:09.712 --> 16:13.983
I heard General Jin Bok is unable to move due to a stroke.

195
16:18.721 --> 16:20.156
Lord Yeom Jong.

196
16:20.222 --> 16:23.893
I only have a ragtag group of private soldiers,

197
16:23.959 --> 16:26.662
so I am not fit to step forward.

198
16:31.400 --> 16:36.372
Among all these generals, there is no one to protect the nation.

199
16:39.108 --> 16:40.109
Your Majesty.

200
16:41.777 --> 16:44.580
General Kim Yu Sin is stationed on the outskirts of Seorabeol, is he not?

201
16:47.483 --> 16:49.618
Give that fierce general 10,000 troops...

202
16:49.685 --> 16:52.154
and have him face the armies of both nations.

203
16:54.290 --> 16:55.357
Are you suggesting...

204
16:56.826 --> 16:59.395
to have General Yu Sin stop the armies of two nations on his own?

205
17:01.697 --> 17:06.302
Kim Yu Sin is the one who defeated the Baekje army with only old soldiers.

206
17:13.442 --> 17:20.015
If we end up losing Kim Yu Sin, what will become of this nation?

207
17:21.350 --> 17:25.788
He wants us to face two nations with only 10,000 troops.

208
17:26.188 --> 17:29.558
Bi Dam is trying to kill you without getting his own hands dirty.

209
17:29.625 --> 17:32.328
With the private soldiers in Seorabeol, we would have 30,000 troops.

210
17:32.394 --> 17:33.429
(Juk Ji, Silla's general, a Jingol)

211
17:33.496 --> 17:34.697
Why will they not send them?

212
17:36.765 --> 17:38.534
- Heum Sun. - Yes, General.

213
17:38.601 --> 17:42.338
Take 5,000 men with you and head to Dangseong.

214
17:42.404 --> 17:45.107
You must ride day and night to Dangseong.

215
17:45.174 --> 17:49.211
- You must protect Dangseong Fortress. - Yes, I will keep that in mind.

216
17:49.278 --> 17:54.517
Mun Yeong, lead 3,000 infantry and head to the Goguryeo border.

217
17:54.583 --> 17:57.920
I will pin down Yeon Gae So Mun first, but if the situation worsens,

218
17:58.020 --> 18:00.289
you will head to Dangseong and join Heum Sun.

219
18:00.356 --> 18:02.925
I will send messengers from time to time.

220
18:02.992 --> 18:04.627
I will follow your orders!

221
18:06.028 --> 18:11.333
I will leave for the Goguryeo border with 2,000 cavalry now.

222
18:13.269 --> 18:17.006
If Yeon Gae So Mun's armored cavalry meets with Baekje,

223
18:18.707 --> 18:20.209
our Silla is finished.

224
18:22.778 --> 18:23.979
General Kim.

225
18:24.046 --> 18:25.481
Do you intend...

226
18:25.548 --> 18:27.416
to stop Yeon Gae So Mun's 50,000 with just 2,000 men?

227
18:27.483 --> 18:29.285
If we fought by numbers,

228
18:29.351 --> 18:30.920
we would be dead already.

229
18:30.986 --> 18:33.155
If we catch the enemy off guard and use the terrain,

230
18:33.222 --> 18:35.658
2,000 can do the work of 20,000.

231
18:36.392 --> 18:41.263
General, if you lose without even getting a proper chance to fight Yeon Gae So Mun,

232
18:41.764 --> 18:42.831
that would be disgraceful.

233
18:45.234 --> 18:48.504
I will surely die from that disgrace.

234
18:52.408 --> 18:53.409
I will go.

235
18:59.915 --> 19:04.086
Why would I hand over the fun of fighting Yeon Gae So Mun to you?

236
19:04.954 --> 19:07.656
A fight is meant for the enemy.

237
19:08.524 --> 19:12.728
Pour your anger into the enemy and cast away your anxiety.

238
19:16.765 --> 19:19.868
This battle must be won.

239
19:20.869 --> 19:24.173
Men, let us consider ourselves the last soldiers of Silla and fight!

240
19:24.239 --> 19:27.109
All units, march!

241
19:27.176 --> 19:29.011
- Yes, General! - Yes, General!

242
19:29.078 --> 19:32.481
Kim Yu Sin's troops shall protect Silla!

243
19:32.548 --> 19:35.784
- Protect the country! - Protect the country!

244
19:35.851 --> 19:41.724
- Long live, Kim Yu Sin! Long live, Silla! - Long live, Kim Yu Sin! Long live, Silla!

245
19:42.391 --> 19:44.727
(Daeyaseong, Silla, modern-day Hapcheon)

246
20:00.709 --> 20:05.848
Namu barabaljae palayang baramidaye...

247
20:06.815 --> 20:10.619
Om irijeo isinri suroda...

248
20:13.222 --> 20:16.558
Bisaya bisaya saba...

249
20:47.756 --> 20:50.325
(Geom Il, Silla's official)

250
21:16.885 --> 21:19.321
How far do we have left until the Goguryeo border?

251
21:20.456 --> 21:21.824
Less than 12km remain.

252
21:25.327 --> 21:28.764
Advance at full speed.

253
21:29.631 --> 21:31.767
Advance at full speed!

254
22:13.442 --> 22:14.443
Father.

255
22:15.010 --> 22:16.779
I am worried about Go Ta So.

256
22:17.546 --> 22:19.314
I will go back to Daeyaseong.

257
22:20.249 --> 22:23.152
No, you must help me.

258
22:23.919 --> 22:25.821
We need all the help we can get.

259
22:28.924 --> 22:31.593
I know your hidden talents.

260
22:31.660 --> 22:33.462
You are also quite skilled with the sword.

261
22:35.798 --> 22:36.799
No matter what I am good at,

262
22:37.533 --> 22:39.268
the only person I want to protect is my sister.

263
22:40.702 --> 22:44.907
Daeyaseong is precious, but Silla is wider.

264
22:44.973 --> 22:47.709
And Goguryeo, which is beyond it, is a bigger world.

265
22:48.710 --> 22:50.112
Look at the wider world.

266
22:51.446 --> 22:52.848
Is it not more important...

267
22:52.915 --> 22:55.584
to protect the person you hold dear than to see the world?

268
22:57.619 --> 22:58.954
Let us trust Kim Pum Seok.

269
22:59.888 --> 23:02.958
Right now, we must do what needs to be done.

270
23:03.859 --> 23:04.860
Ah Jin Ham.

271
23:05.194 --> 23:07.429
- We must hurry. - Yes, sir!

272
23:08.063 --> 23:10.332
Increase the speed to Seorabeol!

273
23:10.399 --> 23:13.135
- Yes, sir! - Now, let us go!

274
23:25.080 --> 23:27.649
(Silla-Goguryeo border)

275
23:33.121 --> 23:35.824
- General Kim. - Where is Yeon Gae So Mun?

276
23:35.891 --> 23:38.861
There has been no news since the vanguard appeared two days ago.

277
23:38.961 --> 23:41.129
- They are the only ones. - What?

278
23:45.000 --> 23:46.535
It is a feint.

279
23:48.804 --> 23:50.439
Where are they, then?

280
23:52.708 --> 23:54.509
Fire!

281
23:54.877 --> 23:56.979
(Daeyaseong, Silla, modern-day Hapcheon)

282
23:57.045 --> 23:58.046
- Hey! - Help!

283
24:06.421 --> 24:08.257
Fire!

284
24:11.226 --> 24:12.394
Light this house on fire.

285
24:26.808 --> 24:29.745
The grain and weapon warehouses are all on fire!

286
24:29.811 --> 24:32.481
- Bring General Kim Pum Seok here. Hurry! - Yes, sir.

287
24:50.265 --> 24:51.533
If we had gone to Dangseong,

288
24:53.335 --> 24:55.804
it would have been a difficult battle.

289
24:58.040 --> 24:59.174
As I thought,

290
25:01.343 --> 25:03.178
the heavens are on my side.

291
25:05.314 --> 25:07.049
Yeon Gae So Mun,

292
25:09.451 --> 25:10.786
just what kind of man are you?

293
25:23.398 --> 25:27.602
Kim Yu Sin of Silla is at the border, and Baekje has attacked Silla.

294
25:28.203 --> 25:32.274
King Uija has cleverly found a place to attack.

295
25:34.209 --> 25:36.611
If the Goguryeo army sets out,

296
25:40.315 --> 25:42.684
what will you give me in return?

297
25:46.088 --> 25:47.089
I will return...

298
25:48.357 --> 25:51.793
the territories north of Jungnyeong that Silla took from Goguryeo,

299
25:52.728 --> 25:56.465
and send enough grain for 50,000 troops to last for a month.

300
25:59.735 --> 26:03.505
How will you give away the land of Silla?

301
26:05.240 --> 26:10.679
Just for the Silla army to fall into chaos by Goguryeo's deployment.

302
26:13.815 --> 26:15.951
Is that not what you said?

303
26:18.053 --> 26:19.054
That is correct.

304
26:20.088 --> 26:23.425
Then I will only deploy the troops,

305
26:23.492 --> 26:29.064
and I will use every means to make Silla believe that I am attacking.

306
26:30.032 --> 26:31.199
In return,

307
26:33.235 --> 26:36.004
give me enough grain to feed...

308
26:37.572 --> 26:39.508
50,000 troops for a year.

309
26:47.883 --> 26:48.884
Go to King Uija...

310
26:49.684 --> 26:53.121
- and bring back the grain he promised us. - Yes, sir!

311
27:01.096 --> 27:03.365
- Fire! - It is on fire!

312
27:04.332 --> 27:06.768
We have a traitor. Guard the gates!

313
27:37.265 --> 27:38.533
Are the grain warehouses burned down?

314
27:38.600 --> 27:40.969
The grain and weapon warehouses have all been burned to the ground.

315
27:41.536 --> 27:44.739
- Have they crossed the river? - Not yet.

316
27:44.806 --> 27:48.977
This was an inside job. Who is responsible for this?

317
27:59.821 --> 28:00.889
Geom Il!

318
28:07.729 --> 28:09.631
- How dare you? - Consider yourself lucky.

319
28:10.599 --> 28:13.768
Everything is burned, so there will be no rations left.

320
28:14.402 --> 28:18.306
General Yun Chung of Great Baekje says if you abandon the fortress,

321
28:18.406 --> 28:19.674
he will not pursue you.

322
28:19.741 --> 28:20.742
How dare you!

323
28:24.179 --> 28:27.249
Do you think I am the only one who started the fire?

324
28:30.852 --> 28:32.454
Do you think your wife is safe?

325
28:37.559 --> 28:40.962
Please let the general keep his courage until the end.

326
29:14.930 --> 29:16.998
Father, that is Daeyaseong.

327
29:23.939 --> 29:28.243
Everyone's desires and hatred have turned into flames,

328
29:28.710 --> 29:34.683
pushing the Three Kingdoms into smoke where nothing could be foreseen.

329
29:38.119 --> 29:42.257
Seongje unsaengja biyeongnang siljeong bichijegi jecha cheomaknyujeong...

330
29:42.324 --> 29:46.394
Seongje unsaengja biyeongnang siljeong bichijegi jecha cheomaknyujeong...

331
29:46.461 --> 29:53.468
Seongje unsaengja biyeongnang siljeong bichijegi jecha cheomaknyujeong...

332
29:54.202 --> 29:58.807
Brother, the situation in Daeyaseong seems to be getting urgent.

333
30:00.342 --> 30:02.344
As Minister of Military Affairs, Kim Chun Chu ordered...

334
30:02.744 --> 30:05.680
to check the number of private soldiers in every family.

335
30:10.452 --> 30:14.823
Goodness. I wonder if they are planning to take our private soldiers away.

336
30:14.889 --> 30:16.524
If they want them that badly, let them.

337
30:17.225 --> 30:19.527
There are plenty of people to fill the vacancies.

338
30:22.030 --> 30:25.433
No, that will only provoke Bi Dam's anger.

339
30:29.537 --> 30:30.538
Okay.

340
31:37.472 --> 31:38.473
Do you see the future?

341
31:41.609 --> 31:46.247
Now, what is the fortune of Kim Chun Chu and Bi Dam?

342
31:47.615 --> 31:50.618
Kim Chun Chu is like the midnight darkness,

343
31:51.619 --> 31:55.290
and Bi Dam shines as brightly as the midday sun.

344
32:02.530 --> 32:05.533
The darkness is more appealing now,

345
32:06.968 --> 32:09.504
and my intuition has never been wrong.

346
32:10.705 --> 32:14.008
No matter how much I think about it, if Kim Chun Chu collapses,

347
32:15.143 --> 32:16.778
Silla will also be finished.

348
32:21.082 --> 32:23.118
I will no longer seek you out.

349
32:24.986 --> 32:28.857
Are you certain the first animal you saw today was a pig?

350
32:29.457 --> 32:30.792
I am certain.

351
32:31.993 --> 32:35.663
I hunted it in the mountains, removed the hair, and brought it at once.

352
32:36.564 --> 32:38.366
A pig of the woods.

353
32:40.735 --> 32:43.938
Kim Chun Chu still has one chance.

354
32:49.477 --> 32:53.681
If a tiger cries in the north, a dragon will fly from the North Star.

355
32:54.115 --> 33:00.088
Then the wood pig will become light in Kim Chun Chu's darkness,

356
33:00.889 --> 33:02.023
and Silla...

357
33:04.259 --> 33:05.460
will survive.

358
33:12.734 --> 33:14.269
Interesting.

359
33:29.784 --> 33:32.320
Beop Min, what brings you here?

360
33:33.888 --> 33:37.392
Are you now leaving the matter of sending private soldiers to a fortune-teller?

361
33:37.859 --> 33:39.294
Of course not.

362
33:40.562 --> 33:43.431
You may deny it, but you are just like your father.

363
33:43.498 --> 33:47.302
Why do you think so many steps ahead and make things complicated?

364
33:47.902 --> 33:49.404
It is not about the fortune.

365
33:49.471 --> 33:51.406
I came because I have taken an interest in the shaman.

366
33:51.873 --> 33:53.908
She is the most beautiful in Seorabeol.

367
33:54.742 --> 33:56.878
I thought you were someone...

368
33:57.679 --> 33:59.948
who would be standing in the middle of a battlefield, not beside a shaman.

369
34:04.018 --> 34:07.155
In that strange family of yours, you are the one I relate to the most.

370
34:07.222 --> 34:09.224
Do you think I do not know how you feel?

371
34:10.158 --> 34:15.797
I am doing this because I also want to escape this miserable situation.

372
34:18.466 --> 34:20.268
Please send your private troops to Daeyaseong.

373
34:25.673 --> 34:26.875
Enjoy!

374
34:42.924 --> 34:44.325
(Dancing without music)

375
34:47.228 --> 34:48.229
Lord Seon Pum.

376
34:49.797 --> 34:51.466
It states, "Geumseong Jakmu."

377
34:51.533 --> 34:52.534
(Geumseong Jakmu: to dance without music)

378
34:56.204 --> 34:58.640
Come on.

379
34:58.706 --> 34:59.874
Dancing, of all things?

380
35:00.608 --> 35:03.311
Is it not inappropriate to dance now?

381
35:14.556 --> 35:17.392
Go for it.

382
35:17.458 --> 35:19.093
How amusing.

383
35:38.546 --> 35:41.516
How can you play games with a juryeonggu dice in this crisis?

384
35:45.787 --> 35:47.388
The Minister of Military Affairs ordered you to send troops...

385
35:47.455 --> 35:48.856
a long time ago.

386
35:49.524 --> 35:50.525
Kid.

387
35:51.092 --> 35:54.429
The troops in Seorabeol do not move by the Minister of Military Affairs.

388
35:54.495 --> 35:56.898
- It is the Hwabaek Council... - Convene the Hwabaek Council at once.

389
35:57.765 --> 35:59.133
Forget the Hwabaek Council.

390
36:01.469 --> 36:05.540
Your sister Go Ta So is in danger. Of course, we must act.

391
36:06.975 --> 36:10.044
General Su Se should have finished his preparations to march by now.

392
36:11.512 --> 36:12.580
He is only leaving now?

393
36:19.220 --> 36:20.788
If anything happens to Daeyaseong Fortress,

394
36:24.225 --> 36:25.927
I will not let it slide.

395
36:38.473 --> 36:39.574
Yubeom gonggwa.

396
36:39.641 --> 36:42.143
(Yubeom gonggwa: Stay still even when provoked)

397
36:45.413 --> 36:46.914
I will let it slide this time.

398
36:52.787 --> 36:56.224
Think carefully about why your father is doing nothing.

399
36:57.358 --> 37:00.395
He realized his grave mistake of leaving Daeyaseong,

400
37:00.461 --> 37:02.530
and that is why he is lying low.

401
37:03.831 --> 37:07.502
You should also keep a low profile.

402
37:09.570 --> 37:11.773
I will not be this kind next time.

403
37:47.041 --> 37:49.310
(Daeyaseong)

404
38:11.065 --> 38:12.333
Oh, no...

405
38:16.304 --> 38:18.172
While we were putting out fires,

406
38:18.239 --> 38:21.109
we were surrounded by the Baekje troops that crossed the river.

407
38:21.175 --> 38:24.712
And there is no word of reinforcements from Seorabeol.

408
38:26.013 --> 38:27.682
The men have starved for days.

409
38:28.683 --> 38:30.351
Their morale must be at rock bottom.

410
38:30.418 --> 38:34.455
General, what are you saying? We can still fight.

411
38:36.724 --> 38:38.459
I cannot become a prisoner of Baekje again.

412
38:41.295 --> 38:46.067
If I must die for losing the fortress, let me die by the blade of Silla.

413
38:46.901 --> 38:48.402
They will not pursue us.

414
38:48.469 --> 38:50.705
How can you trust their word and retreat?

415
38:52.006 --> 38:53.875
Rather than begging for life like a rat,

416
38:54.275 --> 38:56.944
it is better to die fighting like a tiger.

417
39:00.681 --> 39:01.682
Juk Juk.

418
39:03.785 --> 39:04.886
This is all my fault.

419
39:06.287 --> 39:07.288
Even so,

420
39:08.256 --> 39:10.658
must we not save the people of Silla?

421
39:14.695 --> 39:15.763
Let us go and live!

422
39:15.830 --> 39:17.064
No!

423
39:18.533 --> 39:20.401
If you want to leave, go ahead.

424
39:21.302 --> 39:23.304
I will stay and fight until the end.

425
40:02.043 --> 40:05.813
I will defend this place until the end, so do not worry and go save Silla.

426
40:08.015 --> 40:10.952
All right, I will see you soon.

427
40:43.985 --> 40:45.786
How dare you, Yun Chung?

428
41:01.202 --> 41:05.273
I have been fooled again by Baekje.

429
41:24.892 --> 41:27.862
You dog! You sold out your country!

430
41:38.205 --> 41:39.573
Watch closely.

431
41:42.209 --> 41:45.146
I am General Geom Il of Baekje!

432
41:45.212 --> 41:49.417
The souls of the Silla people who died because of you will never forgive you!

433
41:52.553 --> 41:54.188
You talk too much.

434
41:55.856 --> 41:56.857
Kill her.

435
41:59.460 --> 42:01.996
The people of Silla do not bow to the enemy.

436
42:03.464 --> 42:04.465
Kill me!

437
42:05.132 --> 42:07.468
Silla will never let this go!

438
42:09.670 --> 42:11.973
It is a pity I will not get to see your father's humiliation.

439
42:12.873 --> 42:17.345
However, your head will cloud your father's judgment,

440
42:17.678 --> 42:19.580
and Silla will eventually be destroyed.

441
42:22.016 --> 42:23.150
Never.

442
42:25.252 --> 42:26.354
Father,

443
42:27.054 --> 42:31.659
look at my head and make sure you crush Baekje!

444
42:43.404 --> 42:47.441
Mother, Father...

445
43:29.050 --> 43:31.352
(Kim Mun Hui, Kim Chun Chu's wife, Kim Yu Sin's sister)

446
43:41.295 --> 43:42.296
Mother!

447
43:42.797 --> 43:44.298
Mother...

448
43:44.932 --> 43:48.969
Her Excellency has collapsed. Quickly, call a physician!

449
43:49.036 --> 43:50.037
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir!

450
44:54.535 --> 44:55.603
No.

451
44:57.872 --> 44:59.640
This is not my sister.

452
45:06.614 --> 45:08.749
Father, that is not her, right?

453
45:09.416 --> 45:10.417
Is it?

454
45:12.153 --> 45:15.156
Please say something. Tell me that is not Go Ta So!

455
46:30.264 --> 46:31.398
My child...

456
46:35.836 --> 46:36.937
My baby...

457
46:40.407 --> 46:41.408
My daughter...

458
47:06.433 --> 47:09.336
(King Seong's shrine, Sabi, Baekje)

459
47:09.403 --> 47:11.772
I offer you the head of Kim Pum Seok.

460
47:22.883 --> 47:24.184
(Buyeo Yung, Baekje's Crown Prince)

461
47:24.251 --> 47:25.252
I,

462
47:26.053 --> 47:30.124
to the cruel King Jinheung and Kim Mu Ryeok of Silla,

463
47:32.192 --> 47:37.364
have avenged His Majesty King Seong, who was wrongfully beheaded.

464
47:38.632 --> 47:42.603
May your soul wandering the underworld now rest in peace.

465
48:19.073 --> 48:21.742
- Long live, Your Majesty! - Long live, Your Majesty!

466
48:26.447 --> 48:27.448
Your Majesty,

467
48:27.948 --> 48:32.386
you have captured Daeyaseong, which was said to be impenetrable.

468
48:32.953 --> 48:34.755
Congratulations, Your Majesty!

469
48:35.356 --> 48:39.226
This is a gift from Yeon Gae So Mun.

470
48:41.528 --> 48:42.529
Yeon Gae So Mun...

471
48:42.896 --> 48:45.566
is the one who ultimately refused your request for a joint attack.

472
48:46.100 --> 48:47.634
Why do you say it is his achievement?

473
48:48.402 --> 48:49.436
Prince.

474
48:49.870 --> 48:50.871
Yes, Your Majesty.

475
48:51.271 --> 48:54.241
Yeon Gae So Mun did not send his troops directly.

476
48:55.075 --> 48:58.812
But did he not deceive Silla with a false dispatch of troops?

477
49:00.381 --> 49:04.818
If Goguryeo reinforcements had come, would we have been able to move...

478
49:05.886 --> 49:10.124
all our troops from Dangseong and reach Daeyaseong so easily?

479
49:11.191 --> 49:13.827
And all while trusting the words of Geom Il of Silla.

480
49:15.896 --> 49:21.168
We learned about Yeon Gae So Mun and took Daeyaseong Fortress from Silla.

481
49:22.970 --> 49:24.004
Is this not...

482
49:25.773 --> 49:27.775
a great success?

483
49:31.245 --> 49:34.848
Once we pass Chogye and Okmungok Valley, we will reach the Hwangsan River.

484
49:34.915 --> 49:38.886
Then we can strike Seorabeol immediately.

485
49:39.520 --> 49:41.588
We will head to Okmungok at once.

486
49:42.089 --> 49:43.390
Soldiers!

487
49:43.924 --> 49:46.460
What are you so happy about?

488
49:48.929 --> 49:50.030
(Queen Mother Sataek, King Uija's stepmother)

489
49:50.097 --> 49:54.501
Is the rumor that you sent food for 50,000 men...

490
49:54.568 --> 49:55.669
to Yeon Gae So Mun true?

491
49:55.736 --> 49:56.937
Was it for 50,000 men?

492
49:57.504 --> 49:58.539
(Sataek Ji Jeok, Baekje's Chief Minister)

493
49:58.605 --> 50:00.974
Your Majesty, did you say 50,000?

494
50:01.608 --> 50:03.210
I have captured a fortress...

495
50:03.877 --> 50:06.847
far more precious than food for 50,000 men.

496
50:06.914 --> 50:10.751
Silla will soon be in our hands.

497
50:10.818 --> 50:13.620
Your Highness, the order is wrong.

498
50:14.154 --> 50:16.023
You have not even repaid the food...

499
50:16.089 --> 50:18.158
you borrowed from the Sataek family for the 50,000 soldiers,

500
50:18.225 --> 50:21.328
yet you want to give 50,000 more to Yeon Gae So Mun?

501
50:21.695 --> 50:26.567
I have never forgotten the kindness of the Sataek family for a moment.

502
50:26.633 --> 50:28.135
This victory...

503
50:28.202 --> 50:32.639
was possible, thanks to the Queen Mother and her family, was it not?

504
50:33.140 --> 50:39.913
Your Majesty, I will repay that kindness with the spoils of the war against Silla.

505
50:39.980 --> 50:43.750
From now on, like the previous kings did, when it comes to raising a large army,

506
50:47.754 --> 50:51.225
please discuss it with me first.

507
50:56.964 --> 50:59.967
I have something to say to you in private, so step outside for a moment, Yung.

508
51:01.869 --> 51:05.005
You all step out as well. I have orders to give.

509
51:33.901 --> 51:36.436
(King Bojang, 28th ruler of Goguryeo)

510
51:43.610 --> 51:50.083
Preserving the lineage of those in the frontier is Tang's noble tradition.

511
51:50.984 --> 51:51.985
(Ko Jeong Eui, Goguryeo's general)

512
51:52.052 --> 51:54.821
The succession of the throne of distant lands...

513
51:54.888 --> 51:57.324
has been Tang's tradition for generations.

514
51:59.593 --> 52:03.697
King Bojang of Goguryeo, whose virtue is widely acclaimed...

515
52:03.764 --> 52:05.432
and whose loyalty is beyond question,

516
52:05.499 --> 52:07.501
shall be bestowed with the titles...

517
52:07.568 --> 52:14.408
as Lord of Liaodong of Shangzhou and King of Goguryeo.

518
52:15.642 --> 52:18.078
His Majesty King Bojang of Goguryeo...

519
52:18.145 --> 52:20.514
Interpret exactly what they said.

520
52:27.888 --> 52:31.158
Since Bojang is virtuous and loyal, like the late king,

521
52:31.658 --> 52:34.294
I grant him the title...

522
52:35.128 --> 52:36.797
of Lord of Liaodong of Shangzhou and King of Goguryeo.

523
52:39.132 --> 52:40.968
The King of Goguryeo...

524
52:41.034 --> 52:46.006
shall receive the edict after showing proper imperial courtesy.

525
52:46.607 --> 52:50.143
The King of Goguryeo shall first pay his respects to His Imperial Majesty...

526
52:50.210 --> 52:51.211
before receiving the edict.

527
52:54.681 --> 52:57.651
I clearly sent a message in my name.

528
52:58.485 --> 53:00.887
Is there no mention of me?

529
53:05.158 --> 53:06.226
Supreme Commander,

530
53:07.294 --> 53:10.797
this is not the time for such things to be included in the edict.

531
53:30.651 --> 53:31.685
Be quiet.

532
53:35.422 --> 53:41.862
Yeon Gae So Mun, Supreme Commander and Grand Chancellor of Goguryeo,

533
53:41.928 --> 53:48.735
asks whether Your Imperial Majesty has any words to convey to him.

534
53:50.737 --> 53:54.641
His Imperial Majesty does not entertain mere generals.

535
53:59.646 --> 54:00.781
The Emperor...

536
54:02.716 --> 54:04.818
does not deal with Goguryeo generals.

537
54:19.066 --> 54:22.569
If the King of Goguryeo does not pay his respects right now,

538
54:22.636 --> 54:25.872
I shall return and report this as a blatant act of disloyalty.

539
54:26.239 --> 54:28.942
If the King of Goguryeo does not show his respects immediately...

540
54:57.671 --> 55:01.842
Your Majesty, this is an edict sent by Li Shimin, the Emperor of Tang.

541
55:02.275 --> 55:05.579
Please come forward, pay your respects, and receive it.

542
55:08.014 --> 55:09.015
I understand.

543
55:31.571 --> 55:32.572
Your Majesty.

544
55:33.673 --> 55:36.409
The officials of Goguryeo are watching.

545
56:13.647 --> 56:20.520
Do not oppose my words in front of the enemy ever again.

546
56:24.858 --> 56:25.859
Your Majesty.

547
56:45.011 --> 56:46.012
Your Majesty!

548
56:46.413 --> 56:49.950
We cannot just watch Yeon Gae So Mun,

549
56:50.016 --> 56:52.352
who brutally murdered Ko Geon Mu, whom Your Majesty had appointed.

550
56:52.419 --> 56:55.088
General Li Shiji is absolutely right.

551
56:55.155 --> 56:59.559
Your Majesty, a coup that lacks justification will not last long.

552
57:00.060 --> 57:03.630
The lords of the fortresses in Liaodong are not following Yeon Gae So Mun.

553
57:04.097 --> 57:07.767
Goguryeo will spill its own blood and collapse.

554
57:07.834 --> 57:08.835
Your Majesty!

555
57:09.436 --> 57:11.705
Yeon Gae So Mun is a man who lives by the sword.

556
57:11.771 --> 57:14.074
One day, he will surely stand against Your Majesty.

557
57:14.341 --> 57:17.210
It is only natural to eliminate him now.

558
57:17.277 --> 57:19.379
Do not forget Wei Zheng's humble counsel.

559
57:19.446 --> 57:21.548
Think of the people who are tired of war.

560
57:21.615 --> 57:25.886
Spare bloodshed now for the sake of a hundred-year legacy.

561
57:25.952 --> 57:27.053
What?

562
57:42.802 --> 57:43.803
Wei Zheng...

563
57:47.741 --> 57:50.677
When I was fighting my brother for the throne,

564
57:52.946 --> 57:54.414
he was my brother's strategist.

565
57:57.651 --> 58:00.887
Wei Zheng told my brother to kill me.

566
58:03.657 --> 58:07.093
After I rose to the throne, I summoned Wei Zheng and asked him,

567
58:08.762 --> 58:10.864
"Why did you want to kill me so badly?"

568
58:12.299 --> 58:14.034
Then Wei Zheng said this,

569
58:15.368 --> 58:19.439
"I am a loyal subject of your brother, Crown Prince Li Jiancheng."

570
58:20.307 --> 58:23.576
"As a subject, advising him to eliminate his most formidable enemy"...

571
58:23.643 --> 58:25.345
"is only natural."

572
58:34.020 --> 58:35.055
Who among you!

573
58:35.989 --> 58:38.391
Who among you can risk your life like Wei Zheng...

574
58:39.859 --> 58:41.828
and speak the truth to me?

575
58:49.469 --> 58:53.740
Your Majesty, Chancellor Wei Zheng has passed away.

576
59:03.249 --> 59:04.284
What?

577
59:05.318 --> 59:06.953
Wei Zheng has passed away?

578
59:54.434 --> 59:57.003
(Ko Yeon Mu, Goguryeo's general)

579
01:00:01.174 --> 01:00:04.077
How dare you put me in such disgrace?

580
01:00:08.314 --> 01:00:09.382
Kill me instead.

581
01:00:16.756 --> 01:00:19.025
Is death all you want?

582
01:00:19.959 --> 01:00:23.596
There are already more than enough who have died.

583
01:00:28.101 --> 01:00:29.135
Look.

584
01:00:32.272 --> 01:00:35.842
He is the hero of Goguryeo who defeated the Sui Dynasty.

585
01:00:38.645 --> 01:00:40.747
Must you go this far?

586
01:00:40.814 --> 01:00:44.784
If he had remained a hero of the past, he would not have ended up like this.

587
01:00:45.685 --> 01:00:47.520
He was a hero yesterday,

588
01:00:48.321 --> 01:00:51.658
but today, he lies dead like that.

589
01:00:51.724 --> 01:00:53.093
You madman.

590
01:00:55.161 --> 01:00:56.162
Kill me.

591
01:00:58.198 --> 01:01:00.467
A general who fails to protect his post...

592
01:01:01.968 --> 01:01:03.703
must die according to the law.

593
01:01:11.945 --> 01:01:13.213
Let me ask you.

594
01:01:14.414 --> 01:01:18.118
Are you the general only to Ko Geon Mu or the general of Goguryeo?

595
01:01:19.586 --> 01:01:23.823
If you still have any loyalty left for Goguryeo,

596
01:01:38.771 --> 01:01:41.708
you should abandon the thought of dying for a man like him.

597
01:01:42.542 --> 01:01:44.244
Goguryeo today...

598
01:01:45.678 --> 01:01:48.081
needs a brave warrior like you.

599
01:01:51.818 --> 01:01:52.852
Please.

600
01:01:57.957 --> 01:01:58.958
Please...

601
01:02:03.830 --> 01:02:05.698
Please bury...

602
01:02:07.567 --> 01:02:08.668
His Majesty's head, at least.

603
01:02:11.504 --> 01:02:12.772
Raise your head!

604
01:02:20.046 --> 01:02:24.150
I will show him special respect.

605
01:02:25.952 --> 01:02:29.022
A great turmoil is coming to this land.

606
01:02:30.523 --> 01:02:32.659
No matter how much you wish not to fight,

607
01:02:33.226 --> 01:02:36.896
a great war, the likes of which this land has never seen, will begin.

608
01:02:41.901 --> 01:02:43.336
Do you not hear that?

609
01:02:44.804 --> 01:02:47.307
The silent and majestic...

610
01:02:48.675 --> 01:02:50.210
sound of war.

611
01:02:52.679 --> 01:02:54.914
I can smell it on the wind.

612
01:02:56.583 --> 01:02:58.818
The smell of the sorrowful blood...

613
01:03:00.753 --> 01:03:02.422
shed by countless soldiers.

614
01:03:28.848 --> 01:03:31.818
Supreme Commander, I am Ko Hye Jin, southern provincial governor of Goguryeo.

615
01:03:32.318 --> 01:03:34.587
When you were exiled to Liaodong,

616
01:03:35.121 --> 01:03:39.926
my father, General Ko Chung San, was the one who helped you.

617
01:03:41.094 --> 01:03:42.095
Supreme Commander!

618
01:03:43.529 --> 01:03:47.133
Please, if you will only spare the lives of my father and family...

619
01:04:18.698 --> 01:04:19.732
Wei Zheng...

620
01:04:21.534 --> 01:04:24.904
I have lost the mirror that reflects my wrongdoings.

621
01:04:28.775 --> 01:04:29.876
Like Wei Zheng,

622
01:04:32.412 --> 01:04:35.815
who else will risk their life to stop me?

623
01:05:15.254 --> 01:05:16.889
Surely, he is not...

624
01:05:34.307 --> 01:05:35.308
Beop Min.

625
01:05:40.279 --> 01:05:41.981
Where on earth have you been?

626
01:05:42.281 --> 01:05:43.282
Where is Father?

627
01:05:55.128 --> 01:05:57.530
(Baekje)

628
01:06:03.169 --> 01:06:04.404
(Goguryeo)

629
01:06:14.113 --> 01:06:16.048
(Baekje)

630
01:06:22.755 --> 01:06:25.158
What kind of scheme are you plotting now?

631
01:06:27.026 --> 01:06:28.127
Have you been drinking?

632
01:06:32.498 --> 01:06:34.767
Go Ta So's soul has not even departed yet,

633
01:06:36.836 --> 01:06:39.238
but are you already calculating your next move?

634
01:06:40.039 --> 01:06:41.107
That is what I am asking.

635
01:06:41.174 --> 01:06:42.775
You cannot control your emotions.

636
01:06:42.842 --> 01:06:44.076
- Leave. - Yes.

637
01:06:44.911 --> 01:06:46.913
I am going mad with rage!

638
01:06:49.682 --> 01:06:51.017
But Father, how can you...

639
01:06:52.919 --> 01:06:54.487
be so calm?

640
01:06:54.887 --> 01:06:56.722
You coveted the power of Kim Pum Seok's family,

641
01:06:57.790 --> 01:07:00.259
which is why you married Go Ta So off to them.

642
01:07:02.662 --> 01:07:03.663
Why did you...

643
01:07:06.666 --> 01:07:09.635
refuse to marry Seon Pum's daughter?

644
01:07:13.840 --> 01:07:15.174
It is because I am sick and tired...

645
01:07:15.641 --> 01:07:18.277
of Jingol nobles who only care about family status and not the person.

646
01:07:18.845 --> 01:07:20.746
I did not expect my father to be just like them.

647
01:07:20.813 --> 01:07:22.515
If you think everything is wrong,

648
01:07:22.582 --> 01:07:25.818
what can you possibly change by doing nothing like you are now?

649
01:07:26.586 --> 01:07:28.521
Will you just watch as the Jingol nobles...

650
01:07:29.522 --> 01:07:32.225
only feed their own greed and eat away at this country?

651
01:07:35.862 --> 01:07:38.498
Must we not set Silla right, even if it means...

652
01:07:38.564 --> 01:07:40.666
we claim power through bloodshed?

653
01:07:43.269 --> 01:07:45.771
Just say that you want to be king!

654
01:07:53.479 --> 01:07:57.617
How dare you speak such high treason!

655
01:08:04.390 --> 01:08:06.959
(Sword & Silence)

656
01:08:35.288 --> 01:08:38.224
Send me to Goguryeo as an envoy.

657
01:08:39.025 --> 01:08:40.259
It is my fault.

658
01:08:41.127 --> 01:08:42.562
I should have been the one to die.

659
01:08:42.628 --> 01:08:45.398
Yeon Gae So Mun will surely try to kill you.

660
01:08:45.464 --> 01:08:48.401
When Go Ta So died, I died too.

661
01:08:48.467 --> 01:08:49.468
Could it be?

662
01:08:49.735 --> 01:08:51.237
I will protect it.

663
01:08:51.304 --> 01:08:52.738
I will surely do so.

664
01:08:52.805 --> 01:08:55.074
If you join hands with Silla now,

665
01:08:55.141 --> 01:08:57.610
any enemy of Goguryeo will also be an enemy of Silla.

666
01:08:57.677 --> 01:09:00.079
How dare you!

667
01:09:04.650 --> 01:09:06.652
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
